      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Muda de Pele. Scraggy puxa a pele frouxa até o pescoço para se proteger. Entre eles, indivíduos com mais pele solta parecem receber maior respeito. Ele dá uma cabeçada repentina em qualquer um que cruze seu olhar, usando seu crânio extremamente duro.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Dragão, Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Scraggy pode evoluir para Scrafty no nível 13 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Headbutt, Leer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Sand Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Feint Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Swagger</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Low Kick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Payback, Protect, Torment</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Beat Up, Brick Break</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Chip Away</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>High Jump Kick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Crunch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Facade</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Focus Punch, Head Smash, Rock Climb</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, Amnesia, Assurance, Attract, Beat Up, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Close Combat, Coaching, Confide, Crunch, Curse, Dark Pulse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dragon Claw, Dragon Dance, Dragon Pulse, Dragon Tail, Drain Punch, Dual Chop, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, Fire Punch, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Foul Play, Frustration, Grass Knot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Lash Out, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Payback, Poison Jab, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Revenge, Roar, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Scary Face, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Smack Down, Snarl, Snatch, Snore, Spite, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Swagger, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Throat Chop, Thunder Punch, Torment, Toxic, T railblaze, Upper Hand, Uproar, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Acid Spray, Amnesia, Counter, Detect, Dragon Dance, Drain Punch, Fake Out, Feint Attack, Fire Punch, Ice Punch, Power-Up Punch, Quick Guard, Thunder Punch, Zen Headbutt</p>",
